The '''Halberd of the Shredded''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sword]]. It is unlocked at {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 8}}, upgrades from the {{Item|Reaper Falchion}}, and is the final form of the {{Item|Undead Sword}}.

