The '''Halberd of the Shredded''' deals {{Green|+250%}} damage to {{mt|Undead}} mobs, heals {{Stat|hp|25}} on hit, and grants {{Stat|Combat Wisdom|+45}} against {{mt|Undead}} mobs.

The '''Halberd of the Shredded'''{{'}}s {{AN|Throw}} ability allows the player to throw their halberd. The thrown halberd damages all enemies in its path, dealing {{Red|10%}} of its melee damage and activating all of its passive bonuses: consecutive throws deal {{Red|2x}} damage and cost {{Aqua|2x}} more {{Stat|Mana}} than the previous, up to a {{Green|16x}} multiplier. The ability costs {{Stat|Mana|20}}.

Unlike other melee weapons that have ranged abilities like the {{Item|Livid Dagger}}, the {{AN|Throw}} ability is treated as a melee strike, causing it to have the same effects and calculations of a melee hit. As such, [[Enchantments]] like {{Ench|Thunderbolt}}, {{Ench|Fire Aspect}}, {{Ench|Lethality}}, etc. will trigger. The {{Stat|hp|25|icononly=yes}} healing on hit and pet abilities will also activate.

The {{AN|Throw}} ability ignores invincibility frames, causing it to hit multiple times per target. This is noticeable on mobs with large hitboxes, such as {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon;Ender Dragons}}, the {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}, and [[Sadan#Phase 2|Sadan's Giants]].

