== Trivia ==
* The '''Halberd of the Shredded''' does not give {{Stat|int}} despite its previous two tiers, the {{Item|Revenant Falchion}} and the {{Item|Reaper Falchion}}, both doing so.
* When first introduced, the {{AN|Throw}} ability would stack more than {{Green|16}} times, even if the halberd did not hit anything. This allowed players to kill {{MobSprite|Necron}} and other high-health enemies instantly with enough {{stat|Mana}}.
* The '''Halberd of the Shredded''', {{Item|Soul Whip}}, and {{Item|Flaming Flay}} are the only weapons where sword swapping is still usable.{{confirm}}

